  "details": "Pretty self explanatory, it's really frustrating to switch back into one of my avatars only to find out the last time I used it I scaled it really larger or really small, and now have to do an extra step of resetting the scale or cloning someone else's scale. Especially frustrating when you are showing people a bunch of avatars or just hopping between them. I like the option of scale saving with the avatar, but I would also love it if I could just disable it saving it with the avatar as a menu toggle\n\n(This is technically a repost yes but I posted the original in the wrong place)",
